The '''Corrupt Goon''' was an [[NPC]] in the basement of the {{zone|Hexatorum}}. They sold the player a {{Item|Rusty Spoon}} for {{c|10k}}.

== Dialogue ==
The '''Corrupt Goon''' said two dialogue lines out of two sets in a random combination.
